---
title: Proposed Forge game - worker I/O and Rust tick handoff
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Main JS thread
    participant R as Rust main thread
    participant W as JS I/O worker
    participant J as Replay journal
    M->>R: Request level
    R->>W: Request cooked assets with generation
    W->>W: Fetch bounded response bytes
    W-->>R: Return correlated bytes or failure
    Note over R: Keep the active room if a required asset fails.
    R->>R: Reject stale replies, verify digest and stage a validated level
    M->>R: Send ordered input edges and frame timing
    R->>R: Run bounded fixed ticks
    R->>J: Retain old input segment and transition
    R->>R: Activate ready candidate at tick boundary
    R-->>M: Publish snapshot and pose for one epoch and tick
    Note over M,R: Main JS draws the frame.<br/>The I/O worker may relay the committed view.
